{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the beginning of the story, you awaken in a mysterious world with your memories lost, and the journey unfolds from there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First, you must learn to survive \u2014 gathering resources, crafting items, and building a camp. You can choose to survive alone or recruit villagers to establish a thriving tribe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you explore the wilderness, you will encounter various monsters. Arm yourself with crafted gear, master magic, and defeat them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a vast journey, follow clues, and unravel the mystery of why you drifted here. Or, you can simply relax and enjoy the pastoral life. The choice is entirely yours!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Core Gameplay Highlights</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fishing</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326670/extras/a337fa4a9903b0538f801ca1b6221d9b.avif?t=1771984071\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326670/extras_big/a337fa4a9903b0538f801ca1b6221d9b.avif?t=1771984071 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hunting and Gathering Resources</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326670/extras/92f8a6a0dd2f41a325a3079b2bc83774.avif?t=1771984071\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326670/extras_big/92f8a6a0dd2f41a325a3079b2bc83774.avif?t=1771984071 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Crafting and Building</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326670/extras/af81e5b695952b2114d14b66aab0da73.avif?t=1771984071\" data-big-src=https://